TI  - Circulation of the low pathogenic avian influenza subtype H5N2 virus in ducks at a live bird market in Ibadan, Nigeria
PY  - 2014
T2  - Infectious Diseases of Poverty
VL  - 3
IS  - 1
C7  - 38
