TI  - Outbreaks of highly pathogenic avian influenza H5N1 clade 2.3.2.1c in hunting falcons and kept wild birds in Dubai implicate intercontinental virus spread
PY  - 2015
T2  - Journal of General Virology
VL  - 96
IS  - 11
SP  - 3212
